From 972825f6ccba754961426e81d1d494c161a007b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 05:18:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: native script parsing and SLP/ALP token protocols

Port bitcoinsuite-core's script module (opcodes, op iteration, script
variants, asm formatting) and bitcoinsuite-slp (EMPP, SLP and ALP
parsing, coloring, verification, burn summaries, LOKAD id extraction) to
C++ under chronik::native::{script,token}.

These are pure functions over transactions with no storage or node
dependency; the indexer uses them for the token, script and LOKAD id
indexes. Every Rust #[test] in those crates (186) is ported one-to-one,
with error and Display texts kept byte-identical because the HTTP API
exposes them (e.g. burn summaries and failed-parsing errors).

Tests: 192 cases, 33,060 assertions in test_chronik_native.

Tier: eCash
